  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "She has white hair and wrinkles, a grand disposition, and a gaze that dominates the crowd. The Southern Border immortals lower their heads. She is grim that they have not deduced Fang Yuan’s location. As long as he is still alive, her reputation as leader of this expedition will keep falling, and Xia clan would suffer if it got serious. She asks everyone to use trump cards if they have them, swearing on her name that she will compensate them fairly. The immortals look around and do not move.",
      "chapters": [
        1598
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "reg_southern_border",
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "fac_xia_clan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "She is familiar with the others except Liu Hao, Wu clan’s representative. An unknown muscular Gu Immortal in a conical hat then appears inside their immortal formation without anyone noticing until he speaks.",
      "chapters": [
        1598
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_liu_hao",
        "fac_wu_clan",
        "sys_gu_immortal"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "She is an old woman with white hair and wrinkles on her face. Even though she is old, she has a grand disposition.",
      "chapters": [
        1598
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "In battle she holds a fan and waves it.",
      "chapters": [
        1603
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Several figures land behind Lu Wei Yin, led by an old woman named as the rank eight time path great expert, Xia clan’s first supreme elder Xia Cha. She hears him say Fang Yuan placed an aperture there and went through a tribulation, and her eyes flash at the depth of those earth path methods.",
      "chapters": [
        1599
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "path-affiliation",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_lu_wei_yin"
      ]
    }
  ],
